==Trivia==
*This is the first enemy to die after attacking once.
*During the [[Version 10.4 Update]], there is a bug where if [[Battle Items#Sniper the Cat|Sniper the Cat]] hits just as it attacks, the unit will somehow remain there and do nothing until it loses all of its health.
**This was fixed in the Version 10.4.1 Update.
*If this enemy hits a cat with either [[Strong Against]], [[Resistant]], or [[Insanely Tough]] vs. Traitless, it will not inflict Knockback. This is due to Wafer Cat XL's 1 base attack, as it is effectively reduced to 0 by these abilities' damage reduction effects.
**Interestingly enough, Slow is still applied.

